@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/sample
@auth = Basic dummy:dummy

### SUCCESS — Gustavo's schedule (365 days to cover all dates)
GET {{baseUrl}}/getVeterinarianScheduleItemItem(veterinarian_id=d31dd6eb-faaf-4d0b-9e84-f13d410e6a2c,days=365)
Authorization: {{auth}}

